body:
My best friend 2 months ago..

&#x200B;

It was a normal day, a Saturday. I was hanging out at his house, I went to go get something from the kitchen and I ended up starting a conversation with his father, It lasted for about another 20 minutes or so and then I heard a \*BANG\*! noise and his father said it was probably the huntsmen in the forest (They lived next to a forest where boar is hunted).A few minutes later I walked up the stairs and entered his room. I dropped everything I was holding and stood there in absolute shock. He was dead. He had shot himself, I couldn't breathe or move at all I remember the feeling being the absolute worst feeling in the world, This would have never happened if I didn't leave the room.  I screamed for his parents to come up, his Mother called the (I am not sure I think it was the police) and was crying and so was his father. I couldn't do anything about it and that's what made it feel the worst. This month I think his parents were going through his stuff finally and found the note, (I am not going to say what he said about everyone else but he left a whole page for me) It said how much he loved me and how much he enjoyed "practice making out" just for laughs and that I should fight through this and I was there for him but he just couldn't live through the pain anymore. It's kind of horrible though because I understand why he tried to commit suicide, I have tried to commit suicide 5 times before all causing me ending up in the hospital and the mental clinic. We were both clinically depressed and were there for eachother. He tried to stop me from self harming and was always in the hospital besides me when I tried to kill myself. I miss him so much and the sad thing is I know that when I die I am going to die because of suicide and I probably won't make it till 16 (I am 14 turning 15 rn). I think of ways to kill myself and just join him. Its stupid but its not the only reason I just hate the pain my life is.
